# The language's vocabulary, one word per line.
# Uzbek (Cyrillic) vocabulary, one word per line — see grapheme.lst for why
# Cyrillic. No Hunspell dictionary exists for uz at all: wooorm/dictionaries
# ships none and LibreOffice ships none, so there was nothing to license-check.
# Built the way hi/word.lst was: every token of the other uz files, both halves
# of misspelling.lst included, plus hand-authored common vocabulary.
